      "chapter": "Complex Numbers",
      "question": "Find the value of \\[\\sum_{n=1}^{4}\\left(i^n + i^{n+1}\\right)\\]",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "\\(1\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "\\(i\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "\\(-i\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "\\(0\\)"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "D",
      "step": "Any 4 powers of \\(i\\) in a row add to 0: \\(i - 1 - i + 1 = 0\\). Both sums are 0.",
      "checked": "Σ iⁿ (n = 1..4) = i − 1 − i + 1 = 0; Σ iⁿ⁺¹ = −1 − i + 1 + i = 0 → total 0. Matches the bank (D)."
    },
